  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_NAME_12
    value: <style=title><size=32>GOLD POT</style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_NAME_11
    value: <style=title><size=32>WILD</style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_NAME_13
    value: <style=title><size=32>RAINBOW</style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_DESCRIPTION_13
    value: "<size=16>- Rainbow Scatter appears on reel 1 only. \n- Collect 7 Rainbow
      Scatters to trigger the Rainbow Wheel Bonus.\n"
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_DESCRIPTION_11
    value: <size=16>- All Wild symbols are collected into the Gold Pot
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_DESCRIPTION_12
    value: "<size=16>- Gold Pot Scatter appears on reels 1, 3, \nand 5.\n- 3 Gold
      Pot Scatters triggers Free Games."
  - key: PAYTABLE_SPECIAL_SYMBOL_PAYOUT_FORMAT
    value: '<b><size=24>5 <style=coinColor>{3:CommaNumber}</style>

      4 <style=coinColor>{2:CommaNumber}</style>

      3 <style=coinColor>{1:CommaNumber}</style>

      2 <style=coinColor>{0:CommaNumber}</style></size></b>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_PAYOUT_FORMAT
    value: '<b><size=24>5 <style=coinColor>{2:CommaNumber}</style>

      4 <style=coinColor>{1:CommaNumber}</style>

      3 <style=coinColor>{0:CommaNumber}</style></size></b>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_MYSTERY
    value: <style=title><size=42>MYSTERY LINK BONUS</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_MYSTERY
    value: "<size=24>- 6 or more Bonus symbols triggers the Mystery Link Bonus.\n-
      User is awarded the sum total of credit values received on Bullet Marks.\n-
      Initial Bonus symbols get locked while remaining spots spin 3 times for free.
      \n- Receiving one or more Bullet Marks in the empty spots re-sets free spins
      to 3. \n- When bonus ends, sum total credit values on Bullet Marks.\n- 15 Bullet
      Marks awards Grand Jackpot!"
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_REVOLVER
    value: <style=title><size=42>REVOLVER FEATURE</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_REVOLVER
    value: "<size=24>- Revolver Feature may be triggered with random probability each
      spin.\n- Revolvers fire up to 6 Bonus symbols. \n- They may also upgrade values
      on existing Bullet Marks.\n- 6 or more Bonus symbols triggers Mystery Link Bonus."
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_FREE
    value: <style=title><size=42>FREE GAMES BONUS</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_FREE
    value: '<size=24>- 3 or more Scatters triggers Free Games Bonus.

      - In Free Games, all symbols except Scatter may appear stacked.'
  - key: PAYTABLE_WAY_INFO
    value: <size=24><color=#00eaff>30 LINES</color></size>
  - key: PAYTABLE_BET_INFO
    value: '<size=24><color=#00eaff>Bet Per Line: 1</color></size>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_LINES
    value: <style=title><size=42>LINES</size></style>
  - key: BUTTON_FREE_SPIN_START
    value: START
  - key: INGAME_LEFT_BOTTOM_RESPIN_COUNT
    value: '<b><size=42><color=#fff94f>{0} of {1}</color></size>

      <size=28>RESPINS</size></b>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_SCATTER_SYMBOL_PAYOUT_FORMAT
    value: '<b><size=24>5 <style=coinColor>{2:CommaNumber}</style>

      4 <style=coinColor>{1:CommaNumber}</style>

      3 <style=coinColor>{0:CommaNumber}</style></size></b>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_JACKPOTS
    value: <style=title><size=42>GRAND & MEGA JACKPOTS</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_JACKPOTS
    value: '<size=20>- Each spin provides the user an opportunity to win the Jackpot.

      - After each spin, either a GRAND or MEGA JACKPOT may be awarded.

      - Jackpots are available for qualifying bets only.'
  - key: CONTENTS_GAME_TITLE
    value: Leprecharm
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_1
    value: <style=title><size=42>COLLECT WILDS</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_2
    value: <style=title><size=42>ADDED WILDS FEATURE</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_1
    value: '<size=20>- All Wild symbols appearing on the reels will be collected into
      the Gold Pot.

      - During each Wild collect, an amount proportionate to the Total Bet is accumulated.

      - Final accumulated amount is used as the base bet during the Rainbow Wheel
      Bonus.'
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_2
    value: "<size=24>- Added Wilds Feature is triggered randomly during reel spin.
      \n- When triggered, the Leprechaun will throw Wilds onto the reel set.\n- Added
      Wilds are valid for that spin only."
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_3
    value: <style=title><size=42>FREE GAMES</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_4
    value: <style=title><size=42>WILD REEL FEATURE</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_3
    value: <size=24>-3 Gold Pot Scatters on reels 1, 3, and 5 triggers Free Games.
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_4
    value: "<size=24>- The Wild Reel Feature is randomly triggered during Free Games.\r\n-
      When triggered, the Leprechaun will turn 1 to 3 reels into Wild Reels. \r\n-
      The Wild Reels are valid for that spin only."
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_5
    value: <style=title><size=42>RAINBOW WHEEL BONUS</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_6
    value: <style=title><size=42>UPGRADE RAINBOW WHEEL BONUS</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_5
    value: '<size=19>- Rainbow Scatter appears on reel 1 only.

      - Collect 7 Rainbow Scatters (for every color on the Rainbow) to trigger the
      Rainbow Wheel Bonus.

      - The final accumulated amount on the Gold Pot is used as base bet.

      - The Rainbow Wheel consists of Multipliers and Jackpots.'
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_6
    value: "<size=19>- Before spinning the Rainbow Wheel, pick coin items for a chance
      to upgrade the Wheel by at most 3 times.\n\n- 3 available upgrade stages are:
      \n\t- Multiplier Upgrade: Boosts all multipliers on the Rainbow Wheel\n\t- Jackpot
      Upgrade: Increases the trigger probability of each Jackpot on the Rainbow Wheel\n\t-
      Add Wheel Markers: Adds additional Wheel Markers to the Rainbow Wheel\n\n- At
      any time, picking the \u201CNext\u201D coin will bring user to a new upgrade
      stage.\n- At any time, picking the \u201CLeprechaun\u201D coin will end the
      Wheel Bonus.\n"
  - key: JACKPOT_UP_COIN
    value: Widen JP
  - key: NEXT_PLUS_ITEM
    value: Next
  - key: INCREASE_ITEM_COIN
    value: +{0}
  - key: MARKER_ITEM
    value: Marker
  - key: NEXT_PLUS_ITEM_LINE
    value: Next + <br>{0}
  - key: LPC_POT_AMOUNT_VALUE
    value: '{0:CommaNumber}'
  - key: LPC_SEGMENT_MINI
    value: Mini
  - key: LPC_SEGMENT_MAJOR
    value: Major
  - key: LPC_SEGMENT_GRAND
    value: Grand
